# OpenTofu/Terraform caches and local state: never publish lab inventory or secrets.
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.terraform.tfstate.lock.info
crash.log
crash.*.log

# Saved plans and JSON plan exports may contain sensitive values.
*.tfplan
*.tfplan.json
plan.out
plan.json

# Private environment-specific inputs; tracked examples remain publishable.
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!*.tfvars.example
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.local/

# Keys, local CLI credentials, editor settings and accidental config copies.
*.pem
*.key
*.pub
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
.terraformrc
terraform.rc
*.tf.bak
*.tf.bak.*
.vscode/

# Keep .terraform.lock.hcl versioned after generating and reviewing it.
